  "pair": "ja-en",
  "title": "時代に流されたら終わりだろ？  (Swept Away by the Times, You're Finished)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "furuya": "古谷",
    "ikezawa": "池沢",
    "takei": "武井"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Detective Takei's nationwide sweep arrests Toshi for underground videos and arrests Ikezawa right outside his gates as the sixty-three-year imperial era ends, before Takei warns Muranishi directly.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "邪魔するよ。摘発だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "荒井トシを薬物使用の容疑と裏ビデオの制作で逮捕する。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "日本のポルノ王を逮捕。明日の新聞の見出しはこれで埋まる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "時代を作ってきた男が時代に流されたら終わりだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "そういうことか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "だけどな村西、勘違いすんなよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "自分で裏に手出したら、俺が直接捕まえに行くからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "覚悟しとけよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "俺を逮捕したいのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "あんたは治安維持のために必要なパーツの一つだ、今んとこはな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "俺らとあんたらは表裏一体だからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "そりゃ約束できねえな。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "邪魔するよ。摘発だ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Pardon the intrusion. This is a police raid.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "荒井トシを薬物使用の容疑と裏ビデオの制作で逮捕する。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We are arresting Toshi Arai on suspicion of drug use and producing underground videos.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "日本のポルノ王を逮捕。明日の新聞の見出しはこれで埋まる。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Japan's industry king arrested—tomorrow's newspaper headlines will be filled with this.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "時代を作ってきた男が時代に流されたら終わりだろ？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Once a man who built an era gets swept along by the times, he is finished, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "ikezawa",
      "t": "そういうことか。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'So that is how it goes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "だけどな村西、勘違いすんなよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Listen though, Muranishi, don't get the wrong idea.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "自分で裏に手出したら、俺が直接捕まえに行くからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you ever touch underground tapes yourself, I will come arrest you personally.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "覚悟しとけよ。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Keep yourself ready for that.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "俺を逮捕したいのか？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you want to arrest me next?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "あんたは治安維持のために必要なパーツの一つだ、今んとこはな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For now, you are a necessary piece for keeping order on the streets.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "takei",
      "t": "俺らとあんたらは表裏一体だからな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because cops like us and guys like you are two sides of the same coin.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "furuya",
      "t": "そりゃ約束できねえな。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Well, I can't make any promises about not coming after you.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
